{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a fully customizable, horizontally scrolling announcement marquee section for the Kiss & Kry Shopify homepage, matching the provided reference image as closely as possible.
    
    ### 1. Layout & Structure
    - Create a full-width horizontal announcement strip.
    - Background: Pure white (#FFFFFF).
    - Height: Approximately 50px on desktop and 44px on mobile.
    - Display all announcements in a single horizontal row.
    - Vertically center all icons and text.
    - No wrapping, no multiple rows.
    - Keep the marquee immediately below the hero section or announcement area.
    
    ### 2. Announcement Items
    Create the following repeating announcement items in this exact order:
    
    1. Free Delivery – Delivery truck icon.
    2. 7-Day Returns – Circular return arrow icon.
    3. Cash on Delivery – Payment/card icon.
    4. Bamboo Viscose – Bamboo leaf icon.
    5. Ultra Soft – Feather icon.
    6. Free Shipping – Delivery truck icon.
    
    Use small, elegant outline icons in muted olive green (#626B48), displayed inside subtle circular pale-beige backgrounds (#F3F1E7).
    
    ### 3. Typography
    - Font family: Montserrat.
    - Font size: 14px desktop, 12px mobile.
    - Font weight: 400 / Regular.
    - Text color: Dark charcoal (#34352F).
    - Keep text on one line.
    - Maintain consistent typography across every announcement.
    
    ### 4. Separators & Spacing
    - Place a small golden-orange circular dot (•) between each announcement.
    - Separator color: #E7A52D.
    - Maintain approximately 20–24px spacing between announcement groups.
    - Keep icon-to-text spacing around 9px.
    - Keep all announcement items evenly distributed.
    
    ### 5. Marquee Animation
    - Implement a continuously moving horizontal marquee from right to left.
    - Animation must be seamless and infinite.
    - Duplicate the announcement items to create a continuous loop without any visible gap or jump.
    - Animation speed: 35–40 seconds per complete cycle on desktop.
    - Slightly faster on mobile: 25–30 seconds.
    - Pause animation on mouse hover on desktop.
    - Avoid sudden resets, blank spaces or flickering.
    - Respect reduced-motion accessibility preferences.
    
    ### 6. Responsive Design
    - Desktop: Full-width scrolling strip with all items in a single row.
    - Tablet: Maintain the same horizontal marquee layout.
    - Mobile: Keep the marquee scrolling horizontally without wrapping or clipping individual text items.
    - Maintain consistent icon and text alignment on all screen sizes.
    
    ### 7. Shopify Customization Requirements
    Provide Shopify Theme Editor settings for:
    - Background color.
    - Text color.
    - Icon color.
    - Separator color.
    - Font size.
    - Marquee speed.
    - Section height.
    - Announcement text.
    - Individual announcement icons.
    - Enable/disable animation.
    
    Allow merchants to edit, add, remove and reorder announcement blocks through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    ### 8. Strict Design Restrictions
    - Do not create cards or boxes around announcement items.
    - Do not add borders between items.
    - Do not use large icons.
    - Do not add gradients or shadows.
    - Do not add buttons or links unless explicitly configured.
    - Do not create a static announcement bar.
    - Do not change the requested single-line horizontal layout.
    
    ### Final Result
    The final section should look like a premium, minimal, continuously scrolling announcement marquee for a luxury bamboo babywear brand. Match the reference image's white background, olive-green icons, beige circular icon backgrounds, dark typography and small golden separators. The result must be fully responsive, seamless and editable through Shopify's Theme Editor., keep only one free shipping or free delivery on order of 2999
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;height:{{ block.settings.section_height }}px;overflow:hidden;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:{{ block.settings.font_size }}px;font-weight:400;--desktop-speed:{{ block.settings.speed }}s;--mobile-speed:{{ block.settings.mobile_speed }}s}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .track{display:flex;align-items:center;width:max-content;height:100%}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-animated="true"] .track{animation:scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }} var(--desktop-speed) linear infinite}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .track{animation-play-state:paused}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .group{display:flex;align-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;gap:22px;padding-right:22px}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;gap:9px;white-space:nowrap}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .icon{width:28px;height:28px;flex:0 0 28px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;color:{{ block.settings.icon_color }};background:{{ block.settings.icon_background }}}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .icon svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .text{line-height:1;white-space:nowrap}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dot{color:{{ block.settings.separator_color }}}@keyframes scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}{height:44px;font-size:12px}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-animated="true"] .track{animation-duration:var(--mobile-speed)}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .icon{width:25px;height:25px;flex-basis:25px}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .icon svg{width:14px;height:14px}.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} .group{gap:18px;padding-right:18px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-animated="true"] .track{animation:none}}
{% endstyle %}
{% capture items %}{% for i in (1..5) %}{% assign tk = 'announcement_' | append: i %}{% assign ik = 'icon_' | append: i %}<span class="item"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">{% case block.settings[ik] %}{% when 'truck' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 6h11v11H3zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="1.5"/></svg>{% when 'return' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11a9 9 0 1 1 2.6 6.4M3 4v7h7"/></svg>{% when 'payment' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M7 15h4"/></svg>{% when 'bamboo' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 20c1-8 5-13 14-16-1 9-5 14-14 16ZM5 20c3-5 7-9 14-14"/></svg>{% when 'feather' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 4C12 3 5 8 5 15c0 3 2 5 5 5 7 0 12-8 10-16ZM4 21l11-11"/></svg>{% endcase %}</span><span class="text">{{ block.settings[tk] | escape }}</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">•</span></span>{% endfor %}{% endcapture %}
<announcement-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-animated="{{ block.settings.enable_animation }}" aria-label="Store announcements" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="track"><div class="group">{{ items }}</div><div class="group" aria-hidden="true">{{ items }}</div></div></announcement-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Announcement marquee","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#34352F"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_color","label":"Icon","default":"#626B48"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_background","label":"Icon background","default":"#F3F1E7"},{"type":"color","id":"separator_color","label":"Separator","default":"#E7A52D"},{"type":"range","id":"font_size","label":"Font size","min":10,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"range","id":"speed","label":"Desktop speed","min":30,"max":50,"step":1,"unit":"s","default":38},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_speed","label":"Mobile speed","min":20,"max":35,"step":1,"unit":"s","default":28},{"type":"range","id":"section_height","label":"Section height","min":40,"max":70,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":50},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_animation","label":"Enable animation","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"announcement_1","label":"Announcement 1","default":"Free delivery on orders of 2999"},{"type":"select","id":"icon_1","label":"Icon 1","options":[{"value":"truck","label":"Delivery truck"},{"value":"return","label":"Return arrow"},{"value":"payment","label":"Payment card"},{"value":"bamboo","label":"Bamboo leaf"},{"value":"feather","label":"Feather"}],"default":"truck"},{"type":"text","id":"announcement_2","label":"Announcement 2","default":"7-Day Returns"},{"type":"select","id":"icon_2","label":"Icon 2","options":[{"value":"truck","label":"Delivery truck"},{"value":"return","label":"Return arrow"},{"value":"payment","label":"Payment card"},{"value":"bamboo","label":"Bamboo leaf"},{"value":"feather","label":"Feather"}],"default":"return"},{"type":"text","id":"announcement_3","label":"Announcement 3","default":"Cash on Delivery"},{"type":"select","id":"icon_3","label":"Icon 3","options":[{"value":"truck","label":"Delivery truck"},{"value":"return","label":"Return arrow"},{"value":"payment","label":"Payment card"},{"value":"bamboo","label":"Bamboo leaf"},{"value":"feather","label":"Feather"}],"default":"payment"},{"type":"text","id":"announcement_4","label":"Announcement 4","default":"Bamboo Viscose"},{"type":"select","id":"icon_4","label":"Icon 4","options":[{"value":"truck","label":"Delivery truck"},{"value":"return","label":"Return arrow"},{"value":"payment","label":"Payment card"},{"value":"bamboo","label":"Bamboo leaf"},{"value":"feather","label":"Feather"}],"default":"bamboo"},{"type":"text","id":"announcement_5","label":"Announcement 5","default":"Ultra Soft"},{"type":"select","id":"icon_5","label":"Icon 5","options":[{"value":"truck","label":"Delivery truck"},{"value":"return","label":"Return arrow"},{"value":"payment","label":"Payment card"},{"value":"bamboo","label":"Bamboo leaf"},{"value":"feather","label":"Feather"}],"default":"feather"}],"presets":[{"name":"Announcement marquee"}],"tag":null,"class":"announcement-marquee-block"}
{% endschema %}